>​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7959em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0448em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4169em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9873em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>学习后，某维的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 若变得很大，说明函数几乎不随该维变化——这一维不重要。于是 ARD 顺带做了软性的特征选择：看学出的长度尺度就知道哪些输入维度对预测有用。这是 GP 相比黑盒模型的一个可解释性红利，与<a href=\"../../dimensionality-reduction/foundations/why-reduce-dimensions\">降维</a>的目标互补——降维在数据侧压缩，ARD 在模型侧自动加权。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谱混合核-自动发现你没想到的结构\">谱混合核：自动发现你没想到的结构</h2><p>手工组合核需要你先知道数据里有什么结构。谱混合核（spectral mixture kernel）反过来——它从傅里叶视角出发，把核的谱密度建模成若干高斯的混合，通过学习这些高斯的位置、宽度、权重，能自动逼近任意平稳核，从而发现你事先没料到的周期或相关结构。代价是超参更多、优化更容易陷局部极值、也更需要好的初始化。实践里它适合「我知道有结构但说不清是什么」的探索场景；结构清晰时，手工组合的可解释核通常更稳更省。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>核在加法（成分叠加，「或」）和乘法（联合调制，「与」）下封闭，构成一门核语法。</li>\n<li>复杂信号可翻译成组合核，如「趋势 + 局部周期 + 短程波动 + 噪声」，结构写在明处、可解释。</li>\n<li>组合核的所有超参仍由边际似然统一学出，不需逐个手调。</li>\n<li>ARD 给每维独立长度尺度，顺带做软特征选择：大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell_d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 该维不重要。</li>\n<li>谱混合核自动发现未知结构，威力大但优化难，适合探索性场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>组合核的超参怎么统一学出：<a href=\"hyperparameter-learning\">超参学习 (边际似然)</a></li>\n<li>组合的原料——各基础核：<a href=\"kernel-functions\">核函数 (RBF/Matérn)</a></li>\n<li>ARD 与数据侧降维的互补关系：<a href=\"../../dimensionality-reduction/foundations/why-reduce-dimensions\">为何要降维</a></li>\n<li>组合模型的比较与选择哲学：<a href=\"../../bayesian-data-analysis/models/model-comparison\">模型比较</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核的组合：像搭积木一样表达复杂结构","id":"核的组合-像搭积木一样表达复杂结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"核代数：两条封闭规则","id":"核代数-两条封闭规则"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可读的组合案例","id":"一个可读的组合案例"},{"level":2,"text":"ARD：让模型自己判断哪些特征重要","id":"ard-让模型自己判断哪些特征重要"},{"level":2,"text":"谱混合核：自动发现你没想到的结构","id":"谱混合核-自动发现你没想到的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"核函数 (RBF/Matérn)：把「函数应该长啥样」写成公式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/kernels/kernel-functions"},"next":{"title":"超参学习 (边际似然)：GP 内建的奥卡姆剃刀","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/kernels/hyperparameter-learning"}}